// GPU settings preset: low
//
// A texture edge of 256 voxels and 2 GB of texture memory, for a weak
// integrated GPU. Such a device can lose its WebGL context on a large texture
// before it reaches the edge that it reports, so the preset reduces early. It
// has more memory than `gpu/low-tablet`, and the same edge.
//
// A preset applies only with final downsampling on, and a preset in this
// customization turns final downsampling on, also in config/default.js.
// Nothing probes the device: a preset is a set of values, so a real device may
// hold more or less than the preset states.
//
// Load it with `?customization=gpu/low`.
{
  "bootstrap": {
    "cornerstone.gpuSettingsPreset": "low"
  }
}
